MATCH_R_X=  Impedance: {0} + j{1} Ohm
MATCH_HINT_TITLE=Matching Suggestions (rough guidance):
MATCH_X_CAPACITIVE=  Reactance is CAPACITIVE (X < 0): Add series INDUCTANCE to compensate
MATCH_X_INDUCTIVE=  Reactance is INDUCTIVE (X > 0): Add series CAPACITANCE to compensate
MATCH_X_GOOD=  Reactance is near zero: Good reactance, focus on resistance matching
MATCH_R_LOW=  Resistance is LOW (R < 50 Ohm): Consider L-network with step-up transformation
MATCH_R_HIGH=  Resistance is HIGH (R > 50 Ohm): Consider L-network with step-down transformation
MATCH_R_GOOD=  Resistance is near 50 Ohm: Good match
MATCH_DISCLAIMER=Note: These are rough guidelines, not precise component values.\nConsult antenna matching references for detailed network design.

